    "snippet": "Stiles Switch BBQ is worth visiting if you want good Texas barbecue with reasonable wait times and strong side dishes, though it rarely ranks as the absolute top brisket in Austin.",
    "snippet_highlighted_words": [
     "worth visiting if you want good Texas barbecue with reasonable wait times and strong side dishes"
    ]
