       {
        "link": "https://www.facebook.com/groups/goodeatsaustin/posts/25747192138200523/"
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "snippet": "Some reviewers on note that while the meats can occasionally lack consistency, the sides and overall casual atmosphere (featuring vintage booths and arcade touches) make the trip worthwhile.",
